# --- TUN 模式 ---

msgid "Make two machines reachable at the IP layer over QUIC datagrams."
msgstr "通过 QUIC datagram 让两台机器在 IP 层互相可达。"

msgid ""
"Make two machines reachable at the IP layer over QUIC datagrams.\n"
"\n"
"Creates a TUN interface (needs root / CAP_NET_ADMIN on Linux and macOS, or "
"Administrator + wintun.dll on Windows) and routes the peer's virtual IP "
"through it. Unlike `serve`/`connect`, which forward one TCP port, this "
"bridges the whole machine: TCP, UDP and ICMP all work on the peer's "
"virtual IP, with no per-port setup. Virtual IPs are IPv4 only. "
"Point-to-point only — see docs/subsystems/tun.md."
msgstr ""
"通过 QUIC datagram 让两台机器在 IP 层互相可达。\n"
"\n"
"创建一个 TUN 接口（Linux/macOS 需要 root / CAP_NET_ADMIN；Windows 需要管理员"
"权限且二进制旁有 wintun.dll），并把对端的虚拟 IP 路由到它。"
"与只转发单个 TCP 端口的 `serve`/`connect` 不同，本模式桥接整台机器：TCP、"
"UDP、ICMP 都能通过对端虚拟 IP 访问，无需逐个端口配置。虚拟 IP 仅为 IPv4。"
"仅支持点对点——见 docs/subsystems/tun.md。"

msgid "Exposed side: accept a peer and bridge this machine to it at the IP layer."
msgstr "被访问侧：接受对端连接，并在 IP 层桥接本机与对端。"

msgid ""
"Exposed side: accept a peer and bridge this machine to it at the IP layer. "
"Prints this node's virtual IP and EndpointId, then forwards all packets to "
"the first peer that dials."
msgstr ""
"被访问侧：接受对端连接，并在 IP 层桥接本机与对端。打印本节点的虚拟 IP 与 "
"EndpointId，然后向第一个拨号的对端转发所有数据包。"

msgid "Dial a peer and bridge this machine to it at the IP layer."
msgstr "拨号连接对端，并在 IP 层桥接本机与对端。"

msgid ""
"Override this node's virtual IP (default: derived from its EndpointId, "
"inside 172.24.0.0/16)."
msgstr ""
"覆盖本节点的虚拟 IP（默认：由其 EndpointId 派生，位于 172.24.0.0/16 段内）。"

msgid ""
"Upper bound for the TUN interface MTU (default 1280). The final MTU is "
"min(this, the negotiated QUIC datagram max); values above 1280 are refused."
msgstr ""
"TUN 接口 MTU 的上限（默认 1280）。最终 MTU 为 min(该值, 协商出的 QUIC "
"datagram 上限)；超过 1280 的值会被拒绝。"


msgid ""
"--mtu must be at most 1280 (got {0}); higher values would fragment the outer "
"QUIC datagrams"
msgstr ""
"--mtu 最大只能为 1280（收到 {0}）；更大的值会导致外层 QUIC datagram 分片"

msgid ""
"the peer or path does not support QUIC datagrams; TUN mode cannot work over "
"this connection.\n"
"Refusing to start rather than silently falling back to a stream transport."
msgstr ""
"对端或路径不支持 QUIC datagram；此连接上无法使用 TUN 模式。\n"
"拒绝启动，而不是静默回退到 stream 传输。"

msgid "running `ip {0}`"
msgstr "正在执行 `ip {0}`"

msgid "command `ip {0}` failed: {1}"
msgstr "命令 `ip {0}` 执行失败：{1}"

msgid "checking local interfaces for the virtual IP"
msgstr "检查本地接口是否占用该虚拟 IP"

msgid ""
"virtual IP {0} is already assigned to a local interface.\n"
"Pick a different one with --tun-ip."
msgstr ""
"虚拟 IP {0} 已被本地某个接口占用。\n"
"请用 --tun-ip 指定其他地址。"

msgid "TUN mode currently supports Linux only"
msgstr "TUN 模式目前仅支持 Linux"

msgid "TUN mode supports Linux, macOS, and Windows only on this build"
msgstr "当前构建的 TUN 模式仅支持 Linux、macOS 与 Windows"

msgid "creating TUN device (needs root / CAP_NET_ADMIN)"
msgstr "创建 TUN 设备（需要 root / CAP_NET_ADMIN）"

msgid "creating TUN device (needs root; macOS uses utun)"
msgstr "创建 TUN 设备（需要 root；macOS 使用 utun）"

msgid "creating TUN device (needs Administrator and wintun.dll next to the binary)"
msgstr "创建 TUN 设备（需要管理员权限，且二进制旁需有 wintun.dll）"

msgid ""
"creating TUN device failed (needs Administrator).\n"
"Use the official signed wintun.dll from https://www.wintun.net/ (amd64 for "
"64-bit), placed next to this executable:\n"
"  {0}\n"
"\"The file is not signed\" means Windows rejected the DLL signature — replace "
"a wrong/unsigned/PATH-shadowed copy with the official one."
msgstr ""
"创建 TUN 设备失败（需要管理员权限）。\n"
"请从 https://www.wintun.net/ 下载官方已签名的 wintun.dll（64 位用 amd64），"
"放到本程序同目录：\n"
"  {0}\n"
"若提示 \"The file is not signed\"，说明 DLL 签名校验失败——请用官方文件替换"
"错误/未签名/被 PATH 抢先加载的副本。"

msgid ""
"wintun.dll not found next to this executable:\n"
"  {0}\n"
"Download the official signed build from https://www.wintun.net/ (use the "
"amd64 folder on 64-bit Windows) and copy wintun.dll here."
msgstr ""
"本程序同目录未找到 wintun.dll：\n"
"  {0}\n"
"请从 https://www.wintun.net/ 下载官方已签名版本（64 位 Windows 用 amd64 目录）"
"并将 wintun.dll 复制到此处。"

