msgid "Install or remove a TUN system service (Linux systemd; macOS LaunchDaemon)."
msgstr "安装或移除 TUN 系统服务（Linux systemd；macOS LaunchDaemon）。"

msgid ""
"Manage a platform service for `tun up --foreground --system`. Requires root. Refuses to install if this binary is under a user-writable path. Identity defaults to /etc/link-p2p/identity.key (copied from the sudo caller's config when missing). macOS runs as root LaunchDaemon; Linux uses a dedicated service user with CAP_NET_ADMIN."
msgstr ""
"为 `tun up --foreground --system` 管理平台服务。须 root。若二进制位于用户可写路径则拒绝安装。身份默认 /etc/link-p2p/identity.key（缺失时从 sudo 调用者配置复制）。macOS 以 root LaunchDaemon 运行；Linux 使用带 CAP_NET_ADMIN 的专用服务用户。"

msgid "Install the TUN system service and start it."
msgstr "安装 TUN 系统服务并启动。"

msgid "Service identity key path (default /etc/link-p2p/identity.key)."
msgstr "服务身份密钥路径（默认 /etc/link-p2p/identity.key）。"

msgid ""
"Linux systemd only: Unix user the service runs as (default link-p2p). Ignored on macOS (root LaunchDaemon)."
msgstr ""
"仅 Linux systemd：服务运行的 Unix 用户（默认 link-p2p）。macOS 忽略（root LaunchDaemon）。"

msgid "Disable and remove the TUN system service."
msgstr "禁用并移除 TUN 系统服务。"

